## Lore

Gizmoteering is the Amaki art that blends psionics, technology and a little
of the logic of techno-wizardry. A gizmoteer can soup up almost any machine on
the spot with a psychic touch, and given time can build devices that store and
release psychic powers. It was gizmoteers who first pierced the walls between
dimensions and brought the Amaki to Earth.

Every Amaki House employs them as designers, researchers and troubleshooters,
and the troubleshooters end up doing everything from security and
investigation to bodyguard work, sometimes alongside the Duelists, who resent
the gizmoteers that fake a psi-sword and pass for one of them. Cheerful and
easy-going, gizmoteers are much more like ordinary Amaki than the dour
sword-masters, and dozens have gone off to explore Rifts Earth, many never to
be heard from again.
', 'published', 'data-script'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'gizmoteer');


